%% Sequence: user opens home page and receives personalized recommendations
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant S as React SPA
  participant A as FastAPI (auth + recommendations)
  participant R as Redis
  participant M as Model store (in memory)
  participant D as PostgreSQL

  U->>S: Open home page
  S->>A: GET /api/v1/recommendations?n=20 (Bearer JWT)
  A->>A: Validate token, load user id
  A->>R: GET recs:{user_id}:{model_version}
  alt cache hit
    R-->>A: cached list
  else cache miss
    A->>D: Load user ratings, hidden, watchlist
    D-->>A: interactions
    A->>M: Candidate scores (content, item-kNN, ALS, popularity)
    M-->>A: scores per candidate
    A->>A: Pick weights by #ratings (cold to warm)
    A->>A: Blend, filter seen/hidden, diversify (MMR)
    A->>A: Build reason per item
    A->>R: SET recs:{user_id}:{model_version} TTL 5 min
  end
  A-->>S: 200 JSON [{movie, score, reason}]
  S-->>U: Render rows with explanations

  U->>S: Click "Not interested" on a card
  S->>A: POST /api/v1/feedback/hidden {movie_id}
  A->>D: INSERT hidden_item
  A->>R: DEL recs:{user_id}:*
  A-->>S: 204
  S-->>U: Remove card immediately
